From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shawn-makes-stuff <shawn.rains@rocketmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:54:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 19/23] rusticc: drop the timed log rotation COSMOS replaced;
 pcprof cast

COSMOS rotates klippy.log by size, so kaliru's TimedRotatingFileHandler port
and its parity harness (qltest, ql_cmp.sh) only remained as unused code and
build warnings. pcprof: the signal handler goes through a pointer cast.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015j6wmNX3xANfteuEeqMb2L
